VTID-05542 (eng-gitlab-m2/settings): commands run and what they showed. Paths are shown as <worktree>. The lane was built in three parts that did not touch each other's files:
part A (sync engine), part B (host files, CI files, Terraform, m2.sh, guard test) and the documentation. Each part wrote its own outputs (a-*, b-*, and the two doc files).

Base: the tip of the M1 branch while M1 (#4692) waited for its review, then rebuilt as one commit on top of origin/main after M1 merged. No M1 file is edited.

