# Not done by rule
No call to GitLab, AWS, GitHub with credentials, Cloudflare or any live system was made (CLAUDE.md absolute rule; collaboration.md §7a). `terraform plan/apply`, `m2.sh install`, `m2.sh status` and the rehearsal are the owner's.
HashiCorp's licence FAQ answered HTTP 429, so the Terraform internal-use reading rests on the licence text alone; AWS Organizations and Image Builder pricing pages answered 404 (the Image Builder user guide was used); Cloudflare's terms returned no text.
